{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "c142bdaa204253e49db3cbb954598ce98b0389fe63c75bd0530fd7ecca96b093", "ja": "Check！　旅のしおり", "zh": "Check！旅行指南", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5834ec0f331b9644d68b26ad61d0daf0ae0352ede1b3c1bf1fbc7ed280a1d827", "ja": "ある日のレッスン後、伊織は雪歩から、エミ\nリーがデュオに気後れしていた事を聞く。公\n演の数日前、伊織はプロデューサーに頼み、\nエミリーと一足先に現地入り。手作りの『旅\nのしおり』を手に、観光に繰り出す。", "zh": "某天练习结束后，伊织从雪步那里听说艾米\n莉对组合感到有些畏缩。演出前几天，伊织\n拜托制作人，和艾米莉提前一步抵达了当地\n。她手里拿着自制的“旅行指南”，动身前\n往观光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c710de22af2d5a9636c0d1f4b65c3da75cb1bbc836b3f6ef923b9d5b8acddf22", "ja": "レッスン終了後……", "zh": "练习结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "e361c458c884b72d9d8f23d468855265a8a33f06492c18d962063fa214dfbb8b", "ja": "雪歩、ちょっといい？", "zh": "雪步，你现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "88c2b4ba7e605c6fa7d9b4b483e3658fb13ca6b79a40497394659e7c9c5287c0", "ja": "あ、伊織ちゃん、お疲れさま。\nどうかしたの？", "zh": "啊，伊织，辛苦了。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "3e2827b1334d3a4333190e93397d12a67cf91cc96cc1eb91bb31956bea59a46a", "ja": "大したことじゃないんだけど……私と春香が\n合流した時、みんなで集まって何か話してたでしょ。", "zh": "倒也不是什么大事……我和春香\n过来汇合的时候，你们聚在一起聊了什么吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b3aab551bff0197460ff6623e3d6628f2af8313816419aa2349f06903ec07011", "ja": "あ、うん。エミリーちゃんがね、\n「伊織ちゃんに相応しくなりたい」って言ってて……。", "zh": "啊，嗯。艾米莉说，她想“成为配得上伊织的人”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "a482e1a776594040c56d7ec1969c811c519335dc72103dde3e697f8b81b9c0f3", "ja": "はぁ？　私に相応しくって、何よそれ。", "zh": "哈？想要配得上我，什么鬼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c2597a4742e023fbc5c153851b9eaf3ef4966cbe764920f2e4c510960572c46f", "ja": "ふふっ。私も、言われたらビックリするかもだけど……\nデュオって、ちょっと特別な感じがするからかな？", "zh": "呵呵。要是有人这么对我说，我可能也会吓一跳，不过……\n可能是因为双人组合，总让人觉得有点特别吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fa32f7d0c330db808ca22980073be763d45711e2bb2ba8b461ee059819ead6c2", "ja": "先輩後輩って、あんまり意識してないつもりだけど……\n自分でいいのかなって、考えすぎちゃったのかも。", "zh": "虽然我本来没怎么在意前辈后辈之分……\n但可能还是想得太多了，忍不住想着，真的由我来可以吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ca9078201ff19e758d6bab8a628a9badd3e861a7a19ea8cc2c2771f43cf9f781", "ja": "あ、でも{$P$}と話して落ち着いた\nみたいだから。心配しなくて、大丈夫じゃないかな？", "zh": "啊，不过她好像和{$P$}聊过之后就冷静下来了。所以不用担心，应该没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "b8e6014c97c51a9f932b26da381dfab09b518e3952dec70b68f6cf150bfc0fd6", "ja": "そう……わかったわ。\n教えてくれてありがとう、雪歩。", "zh": "这样啊……我知道了。\n谢谢你告诉我，雪步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6cea89ac15ff01aa8f75c431150b759db319a3b015199eb1f51ed323dd123727", "ja": "ううん。あ、私が話したってこと、\nエミリーちゃんには内緒にしたほうがいいかも。", "zh": "不用谢。啊，是我说的这件事，\n最好还是先瞒着艾米莉比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "67606bd954e401cd89cafb9af65c390ce25348ad1f6c2e1172dcdf20bbda7e78", "ja": "ええ、そうするわ。\nありがとう。また明日ね。", "zh": "嗯，就这么办吧。\n谢谢你。明天见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1013_se", "source_sha256": "172a52394be90cca6467e0a57d29eba5541a0b314af596f3855f7d00b40d23ab", "ja": "パタン", "zh": "磅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "be0df09563dab0fa43c0156571c101c68102d5b9315faa6ed75903fc7f6654a5", "ja": "……。\nうん。そうよね。", "zh": "……  \n嗯。确实呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1015_null", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "3df46bf7004c0f9c2cdc65ccbb5241b3d1bc70d2944da5af189a13edc75a5b81", "ja": "あ、もしもし、やよい？\nあのね、少し手伝ってほしいことがあるんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，喂，是弥生吗？\n那个，我有件事想请你帮个忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1017_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4687fa46658873427e782cbace0e77faa2e57868d46f86e4c93b79a837913a4e", "ja": "（地方公演の本番を明後日に控え、仙台へやってきた。\n春香達とは、後で合流する事になっている）", "zh": "（地方公演的正式演出还有两天，我来到了仙台。\n和春香她们约好之后再汇合。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "582164c17c38813e3cbb6612de97b94d76f2d3e3e1ad37502e6c35f512491f23", "ja": "（それというのも、伊織に「エミリーと2人で観光する\n時間を作ってほしい」と頼まれたからなんだけど……）", "zh": "（那是因为伊织拜托我，想让我安排她和艾米莉以及2人一起观光的时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "8412d56b2a05d29fbf75967d74465e08b16e5ed81833e66c974e6e5ea0d64e9c", "ja": "仙台観光、とても楽しみです！\n仕掛け人さま、伊織さま、どこから参りましょう？", "zh": "我非常期待仙台观光！\n制作人先生、伊织大人，我们先从哪里开始呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "742072de5f9516248a14240e0ca4145da947afd796a3e0459f6005b95eccbf79", "ja": "その前に、ちょっといい？\nはい、これはエミリーの分。こっちはアンタの分よ。", "zh": "在那之前，先等一下。\n这个是艾米莉的，这个是你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "579850d634fb6be7bb407f766126d7aaa559c6634f5453005dbd3aa1781198ad", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。\nこれは……『旅のしおり』？", "zh": "啊，谢谢。\n这是……“旅行手册”？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "7a2573a56af190f3313d04f75693655b088072fc85493f36d3f8d6a454e66841", "ja": "ええ。やよいに話を聞いて、作ってみたの。\nやよいの学校では、こういうのを作るんですって。", "zh": "是的。我听弥生说了之后，试着做了一份。\n听说弥生的学校会做这种东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1024_007ior", "source_sha256": "139c0a19de6d56da856cba429bd9195f3094e2bc7053f6dc0a4b891a36d8c5ea", "ja": "旅行の観光名所とか、名物の食べ物とか……\nつまり、手作りのガイドブックみたいなものね。", "zh": "像旅行景点、特色美食之类的……\n也就是说，算是手工制作的旅游指南吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "8aecfe2b49621f9e744352465a817c2b196ff283fd4e13f77a5cc33c72ac9cde", "ja": "仙台の名所が、いろいろまとまっているんですね！\nこれは……ずんだ餅の甘味専門店！？", "zh": "仙台的名胜景点，各种信息都整理在一起了呢！\n这是……专门卖甜味糯米团子的店！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "2f163165aef73bc6f34809ea645bcec047d6adfbf2659ec082dc71eed4111121", "ja": "そのお店だったら、駅の中にもあったはずよ。\n……ほら、あれがそうじゃない？", "zh": "如果是那家店的话，车站里应该也有一家。\n……你看，那家是不是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "4cd58eb590f32c7ad857f989ba51c2b846a71a0703061503f8b743b6fac3274f", "ja": "さっそく、行ってみましょ！", "zh": "我们马上去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1029_007ior", "source_sha256": "5f30cfcc8165085fcad95da6c78b2a87eec9ff87a212b7ed2a5b9e228652f6ca", "ja": "んん～！　お餅が口の中でとろけるわ～。", "zh": "嗯～！年糕在嘴里化开了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "8fb3d085e6ff116fed0280c0a690ab00d3b49c610fda64c10296a570feb66760", "ja": "うっ……ゲホッ、ゲホッ。\nい、急いで食べたら、お餅が、喉に詰まって……。", "zh": "唔……咳、咳。\n吃、吃太急，年糕卡在喉咙里了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1031_007ior", "source_sha256": "675b6a5fd68291bc9e60e11ed0089e497fd2342ed8ce5911265ee2238600546f", "ja": "もう……何やってるのよ。\nそんなに慌てて食べなくてもいいじゃない。", "zh": "真是的……你在干什么啊。\n又不用吃得那么着急。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1032_032emi", "source_sha256": "f1eff49a8041ee205a49978abd08c98c912ba8d647bf873e13ceaf5bcfaeea54", "ja": "し、仕掛け人さま、お茶をどうぞ！", "zh": "那、那个……制作人，请喝茶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "12b82795316a866b1bdf7bc49b5a949be4d2cefa16e1f33f9d7a5ec919708709", "ja": "ああ……ありがとう、エミリー。\n助かったよ……。", "zh": "啊……谢谢你，艾米莉。\n帮大忙了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "cf3e250dfb9b0310db0786c67e5e782ea84c2a4248dd021fb06c0a15fe4ba443", "ja": "いいえ！\n魔法瓶、持ってきて正解でしたね。", "zh": "不！\n带保温瓶来真是太好了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "837c99721ed92eaa7f8c451f9b33e8c05a4c02794775ffb865c1aefa840e0a5e", "ja": "それにしても、ずんだ餅、おいしかったです……♪\nお餅が柔らかくて、ずんだ餡が優しい甘さで……。", "zh": "话说回来，毛豆糯米团子真好吃啊……♪\n糯米团子软软的，毛豆馅甜得很温和……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "12fa58ff9cf6627e12cb03aa43fe36f4315d23cb77c1e13e74f1b16a310a078a", "ja": "それじゃお腹も満たしたし、そろそろ移動しようか。\n伊織、エミリー、行きたいところはあるか？", "zh": "那么肚子也填饱了，差不多该出发了吧。\n伊织、艾米莉，有想去的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1037_032emi", "source_sha256": "9534c7bac8c5cc4b7133cac69513fea37b1e8a9b23c7c6cfc87d5e10b4e2c5d4", "ja": "そうですね。\nでは、先ほどいただいた旅のしおりを……。", "zh": "是啊。那么，就先看看刚才拿到的旅行手册……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1038_032emi", "source_sha256": "bb1af4742b7d766e755d74b029a54f106cef3af0946db349609d7b8bffb0d896", "ja": "伊織さま、仕掛け人さま。\n私、この大崎八幡宮に行ってみたいです！", "zh": "伊织大人、制作人大人。\n我想去一趟大崎八幡宫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1039_007ior", "source_sha256": "c15d3390e434e2546320695c58e117b2ffc940380352556bedec7295a7616dd9", "ja": "たしか、伊達政宗が建てた神社ね。いいんじゃない？\nMCのネタにもなりそうだし、行ってみましょ！", "zh": "我记得，这是一座由伊达政宗修建的神社吧。挺不错的嘛？\n说不定还能当作MC的素材，我们去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1041_007ior", "source_sha256": "164431dd18497bde1fd95895e9663edd9db1bf491557dd388f4176176974413f", "ja": "ここが大崎八幡宮ね。\nあのお社、写真より、ずっと風情があるじゃない♪", "zh": "这里就是大崎八幡宫啊。  \n那座社殿比照片上更有风情呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1042_032emi", "source_sha256": "095c6b342a5b4b1f360d2dc9ee8f683796d6b785967e3604e92bc961c248acd8", "ja": "はい！　彫刻や彫金が、本当に見事ですね……\nこちらは、安土桃山時代の建築なんだそうですよ！", "zh": "没错！雕刻和金属雕饰，真的精美绝伦呢……\n听说这里的建筑是安土桃山时代的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "202e70571fec48f1d413c5f9aa83a9290b000d427449f4b9f75fa8b80e42a7aa", "ja": "さすが、詳しいんだな、エミリー。", "zh": "不愧是你，艾米莉，真是了解得很详细啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "b1bde52a543b28b9307ed890ea7283f1bd84192fbbbb55f50ddb654c22151670", "ja": "日本の寺社仏閣には、前から興味があって……\n今回のために、予習してきたんです♪", "zh": "我以前就对日本的寺院和神社很感兴趣……\n为了这次活动，我还提前做了功课呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1045_007ior", "source_sha256": "ad559f67f508e3ea3d74fe66a309a6ac5474bac2bd48340cfdda14ab4453c2ea", "ja": "私は、学校の授業で習ったくらいしか覚えてないわ。\nしおりを作っていて、思い出したことも多いし。", "zh": "我只记得学校课上学过的那些。做手册的时候，也想起了很多事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1046_p", "source_sha256": "0f41f93b54683f667b8a142707608f19a63bf4cfb4419128dc6a303121640ec5", "ja": "すごいな、ふたりとも。俺なんて、\n教科書に載っていたかどうかも覚えてないな……。", "zh": "真厉害啊，你们两个。我连有没有在教科书上出现过都不记得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1047_007ior", "source_sha256": "687aeba8e995708ac8889b6f5a11dcec86aa5e3673253fdb74ae7d62ae8ada2e", "ja": "アンタはいい加減なだけでしょ、もう！\nねえエミリー、せっかくだからもっといろいろ教えて。", "zh": "你只是不够认真而已，真是的！\n对了，艾米莉，难得有这个机会，再多教我一些吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1048_007ior", "source_sha256": "a620e570eea524f14cd52feb0ffbec50f03d4c2c61cc016a30a5b7245fe3c3fd", "ja": "旅のしおりに、書き込めるスペースを作ってあるの。\nこうしておけば忘れないし、MCのネタになるでしょ？", "zh": "我在旅行手册上留了可以写东西的空白。这样就不会忘记了，还能成为MC的话题，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1049_032emi", "source_sha256": "067aae3050550829979e66170ab3be41ed698f85243306b6dfe2b86aa8dbbe4e", "ja": "まぁ……さすが伊織さまですね！\n魔法瓶のお茶といい、しおりといい……完璧です！", "zh": "哎呀……真不愧是伊织大人呢！\n无论是保温杯里泡的茶，还是旅行手册……都太完美了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_05_1050_007ior", "source_sha256": "ad08ed19b78674f04a1f7e653bed168b793010e5f921b728155832daac50d6c7", "ja": "別に、そんなことないわよ。……ちょっとアンタ、\n何ニヤニヤしてるの！　次行くわよ、次！", "zh": "没什么，也没有你说的那么夸张。……喂，你干吗在那儿傻笑！我们去下一个地方，下一个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
